  nodeId: Interview Yuki
  speakerName: 
  lineText: "The camera settles on Yuki Tanaka across a plain, metal table. She sits
    perfectly straight, her hands folded neatly in front of her, the picture of a
    professional holding it together after a shock.\r\n\r\n<b>[DEDUCTION CLIPBOARD
    ACTIVE]</b>\r\n<i>PHYSICAL EVIDENCE</i>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<i>You currently have
    no physical clues to present. Select a baseline topic for Detective Miller to
    press her on.</i>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Detective Miller:</b>\r\n\"Her story
    is ironclad. We aren't getting anything else out of her without physical proof.\"\r\n\r\n<i>[YUKI
    TANAKA'S STATEMENT LOGGED]</i>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r"
  category: 0
